        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion Curved Stainless Steel Passage Lever Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe gentle curving shape not only adds a contemporary sleek look, it fits nicely in the hand. Brushed Stainless Steel finish this passage lever set will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors with  a 2-3/8 inch backset. Passage function for Hall or Closet doors that don't need locking.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the  Curved Stainless Steel Passage Lever Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Curved Stainless Steel Passage Lever Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function:  Passage</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThis item is Discontinued.\r\n</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
